 <flag name="SpaceShower:dipoleRecoil" default="off"> 
 Option to switch on the dipole-recoil scheme as described above. 
 </flag> 
+
+<flag name="SpaceShower:IFquarkCollinearCorrection" default="off">
+Experimental quark initial-final numerator correction. For q to qg with
+an outgoing quark colour partner, multiply the branching veto weight by
+(x^2+z1^2)/(1+x^2), where x=z and z1=1-z*Q2/(m2ColPair-m2ColPartner).
+This restores the massless outgoing quark collinear numerator without
+changing the incoming collinear or soft-gluon limit. Use with local recoil,
+ME corrections off, and matching counterterms for this modified rate.
+The recoil map, quark masses and other splitting channels are unchanged.
+The default off reproduces the stock shower.
+</flag>
  
